        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britney Spears, Nicole Morier, Selena Gomez, Madonna, Patrick Leonard\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", \"La Isla Bonita\"\n- Topics: songwriting, Latin pop influence\n\nFacts:\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier wrote the songs \"Rock Me In\" and \"Whiplash.\"\n- \"Whiplash\" was recorded by Selena Gomez & the Scene.\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier also wrote one other song with a Latin pop influence.\n- The Latin pop influence of that other song is described as similar to Madonna's lead single \"La Isla Bonita.\"\n- Madonna and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita.\"",
