        "original_id": "90772f8e-182e-5407-abf5-339efbd78905",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Mmm Papi\", \"La Isla Bonita\", \"Whiplash\", \"Rock Me In\", \"True Blue\"\n- People: Madonna, Patrick Leonard, Bruce Gaitsch, Selena Gomez & the Scene\n- Topics: Latin pop influence, songwriting, production\n\nFacts:\n- In 1986, Madonna released the song \"La Isla Bonita\" on her third studio album \"True Blue\".\n- In 1987, Madonna's \"La Isla Bonita\" was noted as a point of comparison for the Latin pop influence of \"Mmm Papi\".\n- Madonna and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- Bruce Gaitsch provided additional songwriting for \"La Isla Bonita\".\n- The same writers wrote \"Mmm Papi\", \"Rock Me In\", and \"Whiplash\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
